<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>RHEL Image Mode on AWS</title>
  <style>
    body {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 80px auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }

    .box {
      padding: 2rem;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <h1>RHEL {{ image_mode_rhel_release }} Image Mode</h1>
    <p>This NGINX server was built as a bootc container image.</p>
    <p>
      The image was converted into an AWS AMI and deployed through
      Red Hat Satellite.
    </p>
    <p>Container image: {{ image_mode_image_reference }}</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
